Changes made to the original (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
- Renamed the project and its Python package.
- Removed every tool that writes to LinkedIn or reads private conversations:
  send_message, reply_to_conversation, connect_with_person,
  archive_conversation, dismiss_job, get_easy_apply_form, get_inbox,
  get_conversation, search_conversations, get_feed, search_posts and
  get_sidebar_profiles. The code behind them was deleted, not disabled.
- Split the read-only profile-URN lookup out of the former message-sending
  module into linkedin/profile_urn.py.
- Added call pacing (call_pacing.py) that spaces browser tool calls apart.

